# s2b-link-machine: native/core/crates/mixdog-connections/Cargo.toml (dependency edges only)

In `[dependencies]` of mixdog-connections, after `mixdog-protocol = { workspace = true }`:

    mixdog-rt = { workspace = true }
    async-trait = { workspace = true }
    tokio = { workspace = true, features = ["rt", "sync", "time"] }

New `[dev-dependencies]` (same shape as mixdog-agent's test-feature unification):

    mixdog-rt = { workspace = true, features = ["test-support", "virtual-clock"] }
    tokio = { workspace = true, features = ["rt", "macros", "sync", "time", "test-util"] }

mixdog-rt, async-trait and tokio are already workspace dependencies and in Cargo.lock; mixdog-rt becomes a new dependency edge of
mixdog-connections, so `cargo update --workspace --offline` and `cargo hakari generate` follow.

lib.rs already declares `pub mod link_machine;` (the scaffold); it needs no change. No protocol rows, no SERVICE_PENDING names.
